      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">Which Charge Is This?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Lines point inward, dense near the center</text><circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"560\" r=\"60\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.2)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"582\" font-size=\"64\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"serif\">?</text><line x1=\"850\" y1=\"560\" x2=\"625\" y2=\"560\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"625,560 645,551 645,569\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"560\" x2=\"475\" y2=\"560\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"475,560 455,551 455,569\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"490\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"550,490 541,468 559,468\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"860\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"630\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"550,630 541,652 559,652\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><line x1=\"762\" y1=\"348\" x2=\"602\" y2=\"508\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"602,508 624,502 610,488\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><line x1=\"338\" y1=\"348\" x2=\"498\" y2=\"508\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"498,508 476,502 490,488\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><line x1=\"762\" y1=\"772\" x2=\"602\" y2=\"612\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"602,612 610,634 624,618\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><line x1=\"338\" y1=\"772\" x2=\"498\" y2=\"612\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"498,612 490,634 476,618\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Inward arrows &#8594; negative. Dense lines &#8594; strong field.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Inward-pointing lines mark a negative charge; their crowding near the center shows the field is strongest close in."
