     "type": "quiz",
     "title": "Knowledge Check: Why Sunlight Reaches Us",
     "content": "",
     "question": "Sound cannot travel across the vacuum of space, but sunlight crosses 150 million km of it to reach Earth. What is the fundamental reason light can do this?",
     "options": [
      {
       "text": "An EM wave is made of the electric and magnetic fields themselves, so it needs no medium to travel through",
       "correct": true
      },
      {
       "text": "Light is faster than sound, so it pushes through the vacuum before it can stop",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "Space is actually full of a thin gas that carries the light like air carries sound",
       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "The Sun's gravity pulls the light across the empty gap to Earth",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "An electromagnetic wave is an oscillation of the electric and magnetic fields, which exist even in empty space. Because the changing fields regenerate each other, the wave is self-propagating and requires no medium — unlike sound, which needs air or another material to carry its pressure vibrations. That's why light crosses the vacuum and sound cannot.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">Knowledge Check</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">Why light crosses the void</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"180\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.10)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">SOUND</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">is a vibration</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">OF a medium</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"380\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">(air molecules)</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">no air =</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">no sound</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"600\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">medium required</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"180\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.10)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"780\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">LIGHT</text><text x=\"780\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">is a vibration</text><text x=\"780\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">OF the fields</text><text x=\"780\" y=\"380\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">themselves</text><text x=\"780\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">fields exist in</text><text x=\"780\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">empty space</text><text x=\"780\" y=\"600\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">no medium needed</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"740\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.08)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">The wave carries itself</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"850\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">changing E makes B, changing B makes E</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">so it crosses the vacuum unaided</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Light needs no medium because it is a self-regenerating oscillation of the fields, which exist even in empty space."
     }
